    'CurseForge и Prism понимают .zip с manifest.json, Modrinth — .mrpack, MultiMC/Prism — .zip с instance.cfg и mmc-pack.json.': 'CurseForge ва Prism .zip-ро бо manifest.json мефаҳманд, Modrinth .mrpack ва MultiMC/Prism як .zip бо instance.cfg ва mmc-pack.json -ро истифода мебарад.',
